{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a complete astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times may differ by hours and the UTC date displayed may differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimation does not calculate local moonrise and moonset dates, visibility, or religious calendar.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Usa un cicle sinòdic mitjà ancorat a una lluna nova de referència, no una efemèride astronòmica completa. Els temps de fase individuals poden diferir per hores i la data UTC mostrada pot diferir d' una data del calendari local. Aquesta estimació de fase global no calcula les dates locals de sortida i posta de la lluna, visibilitat o calendari religiós.","record_id":"f2dab69cae7f4623f7c3dcd8491ab585c8bef823e3a21d32a073991388b25ef7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.3878881482500063,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Usa un cicle sinòdic mitjà ancorat a una lluna nova de referència, no una efemèride astronòmica completa. Els temps de fase individuals poden diferir per hores i la data UTC mostrada pot diferir d' una data del calendari local. Aquesta estimació de fase global no calcula les dates locals de sortida i posta de la lluna, visibilitat o calendari religiós.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
